shaderbg (1.4.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Add `input_passthrough` preset option to control mouse and keyboard event passthrough
  * Add `track_pointer` preset option to control pointer tracking when no mouse button is held
  * Add `--exclusive-zone ZONE` command-line option to override the render window's layer-shell exclusive zone
  * Add `--input-layer LAYER` command-line option to override the input-capture window's layer
  * Add a Nix flake
  * Update dependencies to their latest versions

 -- Harlen Batagelo <hbatagelo@gmail.com>  Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0300

shaderbg (1.3.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Add `background_color` option to configure the underscan color
  * Log TOML parse errors with specific failure reasons and gracefully fall back to the defaults
  * Clear framebuffers upon creation to prevent artifacts from uninitialized memory
  * Render first frame immediately on throttled animations
  * Vendor and patch `epoxy` to use the latest version of `gl_generator`
  * Update to the latest dependencies
  * Make `layout_mode="center"` span the global virtual desktop on multi-monitor setups (tiling is still per monitor)

 -- Harlen Batagelo <hbatagelo@gmail.com>  Mon, 17 Ago 2026 15:00:00 -0300

